text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Artifact spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', "As The Rack enters the battlefield, choose an opponent.\\nAt the beginning of the chosen player's upkeep, The Rack deals X damage to that player, where X is 3 minus the number of cards in their hand.", "At the beginning of each opponent's end step, if you didn't lose life this turn, you may put a quest counter on Luminarch Ascension. (Damage causes loss of life.)\\n{1}{W}: Create a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying. Activate only if Luminarch Ascension has four or more quest counters on it.", "At the beginning of each player's draw step, if Howling Mine is untapped, that player draws an additional card.", "At the beginning of each player's draw step, that player draws two additional cards.", 'At the beginning of each upkeep, create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', "Banefire deals X damage to any target.\\nIf X is 5 or more, this spell can't be countered and the damage can't be prevented.", 'Blaze deals X damage to any target.', "Blightning deals 3 damage to target player or planeswalker. That player or that planeswalker's controller discards two cards.", "Cast this spell only if you've cast another green spell this turn.\\nTrample", 'Choose three target nonenchantment permanents. Destroy one of them at random.', 'Counter target creature spell.', 'Counter target noncreature spell.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.', 'Counter target spell.', 'Counter target spell. Its controller draws a card.\\nDraw a card.', "Counter target spell. Search its controller's graveyard, hand, and library for all cards with the same name as that spell and exile them. Then that player shuffles.", 'Create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token for each Elf you control.', 'Create a 2/2 green Wolf creature token for each Forest you control.', 'Create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', "Creature spells can't be countered.", 'Creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Creatures you control get +3/+3 and gain trample until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control have double strike.', 'Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\nFirst strike", 'Destroy all nonwhite creatures.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', "Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target non-Elf creature.', "Destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy three target permanents.', 'Dragon creatures you control get +3/+3.', 'Draw X cards.', 'Draw three cards, then discard a card.', 'Draw two cards.', 'Each creature gets +1/+1 for each other creature on the battlefield that shares at least one creature type with it. (For example, if two Goblin Warriors and a Goblin Shaman are on the battlefield, each gets +2/+2.)', 'Each other Warrior creature you control enters the battlefield with an additional +1/+1 counter on it.\\nEach creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has trample.', "Elven Riders can't be blocked except by Walls and/or creatures with flying.", 'Enchant creature\\nAll damage that would be dealt to you is dealt to enchanted creature instead.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 for each Forest you control.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+2.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+1.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has flying and vigilance.', "Enchant creature\\nWhen enchanted creature dies, that creature's controller loses life equal to its toughness.", 'Enchant creature\\nYou control enchanted creature.', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+1.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Equipped creature gets +2/+1 and has haste.\\nWhenever a Warrior creature enters the battlefield, you may attach Obsidian Battle-Axe to it.\\nEquip {3}', 'Equipped creature gets +2/+1.\\nEquip {2}', 'Equipped creature gets +3/+0 and has trample and lifelink.\\nEquip {3}', 'Essence Drain deals 3 damage to any target and you gain 3 life.', "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\\nCrowd of Cinders's power and toughness are each equal to the number of black permanents you control.", 'First strike', 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Razormane Masticore unless you discard a card.\\nAt the beginning of your draw step, you may have Razormane Masticore deal 3 damage to target creature.', "First strike, forestwalk, vigilance (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike, it can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest, and attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)", "First strike\\nShroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'Flying', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\nCloud Sprite can block only creatures with flying.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\nOther black creatures get +1/+1.\\nNonblack creatures get -1/-1.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\nWhenever Thieving Magpie deals damage to an opponent, draw a card.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Sengir Vampire this turn dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Sengir Vampire.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\n{R}: Shivan Dragon gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", 'Flying, double strike', 'Flying, haste\\nWhenever Hellkite Charger attacks, you may pay {5}{R}{R}. If you do, untap all attacking creatures and after this phase, there is an additional combat phase.', 'Flying, haste\\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Garza Zol, Plague Queen this turn dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Garza Zol.\\nWhenever Garza Zol deals combat damage to a player, you may draw a card.', 'Flying, vigilance', 'Flying\\nAs Voice of All enters the battlefield, choose a color.\\nVoice of All has protection from the chosen color.', 'Flying\\nDeathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', "Flying\\nShroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\nYou may look at the top card of your library any time.", "Flying\\nVigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)", 'Flying\\nWhen Angel of Mercy enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.', 'Flying\\nWhen Faerie Mechanist enters the battlefield, look at the top three cards of your library. You may reveal an artifact card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Flying\\nWhen Parasitic Strix enters the battlefield, if you control a black permanent, target player loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Abyssal Specter deals damage to a player, that player discards a card.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Flameblast Dragon attacks, you may pay {X}{R}. If you do, Flameblast Dragon deals X damage to any target.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Goldenglow Moth blocks, you may gain 4 life.', 'Flying\\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Vampiric Dragon this turn dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Vampiric Dragon.\\n{1}{R}: Vampiric Dragon deals 1 damage to target creature.', 'Flying\\nWhenever an artifact creature you control deals combat damage to a player, you may create a 1/1 blue Thopter artifact creature token with flying.', 'Flying\\nWhenever another artifact enters the battlefield under your control, Glaze Fiend gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "Flying\\nYou have hexproof. (You can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", 'Flying\\n{R}: Furnace Whelp gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Gain control of target creature until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack and {T} this turn.)', 'Green creatures you control have trample.', 'Haste', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\\n{T}: Kamahl, Pit Fighter deals 3 damage to any target.', "Hexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\\n{1}{G}: Regenerate Troll Ascetic.", "Hexproof\\nDrove of Elves's power and toughness are each equal to the number of green permanents you control.", 'Hurricane deals X damage to each creature with flying and each player.', 'If a source would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals double that damage to that permanent or player instead.', "Incinerate deals 3 damage to any target. A creature dealt damage this way can't be regenerated this turn.", "Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)\\n{G}: Regenerate River Boa.", 'Jagged Lightning deals 3 damage to each of two target creatures.', "Jagged-Scar Archers's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Elves you control.\\n{T}: Jagged-Scar Archers deals damage equal to its power to target creature with flying.", "Kicker {1}{U} (You may pay an additional {1}{U} as you cast this spell.)\\nReturn target nonland permanent to its owner's hand. If this spell was kicked, draw a card.", 'Lava Axe deals 5 damage to target player or planeswalker.', "Lifelink\\n{R}, {T}, Sacrifice another creature: Brion Stoutarm deals damage equal to the sacrificed creature's power to target player or planeswalker.", "Master of Etherium's power and toughness are each equal to the number of artifacts you control.\\nOther artifact creatures you control get +1/+1.", "Mortivore's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creature cards in all graveyards.\\n{B}: Regenerate Mortivore.", "Other Elf creatures get +1/+1 and have forestwalk. (They can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", 'Other Elves you control get +1/+1.\\n{G}, {T}: Create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token.', "Phantom Warrior can't be blocked.", 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Prevent all damage that would be dealt to Cho-Manno, Revolutionary.', "Put target attacking creature on the bottom of its owner's library. Its controller gains life equal to its toughness.", 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', 'Red creatures you control have first strike.', "Return all creatures to their owners' hands.", 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Return target permanent card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return target permanent to its owner's hand.", 'Sacrifice Bottle Gnomes: You gain 3 life.', 'Sacrifice Elvish Eulogist: You gain 1 life for each Elf card in your graveyard.', 'Salvage Slasher gets +1/+0 for each artifact card in your graveyard.', 'Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Shock deals 2 damage to any target.', "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\nIsleback Spawn gets +4/+8 as long as a library has twenty or fewer cards in it.", 'Spend only black mana on X.\\nConsume Spirit deals X damage to any target and you gain X life.', "Swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)", 'Tap all creatures without flying.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 and gains double strike until end of turn.', "Target creature gets +3/+3 and gains flying until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +X/+0 until end of turn.', 'Target player discards X cards at random.', 'Target player discards two cards.', 'Target player gains 7 life and draws two cards.', 'Target player gains 8 life.', 'Target player mills five cards.', 'Target player mills half their library, rounded down.', "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\\nMolimo, Maro-Sorcerer's power and toughness are each equal to the number of lands you control.", 'Trample\\nBorderland Behemoth gets +4/+4 for each other Giant you control.', "Trample\\nIf damage would be dealt to another creature you control, prevent that damage. Put a +1/+1 counter on that creature for each 1 damage prevented this way.\\nWhen Vigor is put into a graveyard from anywhere, shuffle it into its owner's library.", 'Trample\\nTap an untapped red creature you control other than Impelled Giant: Impelled Giant gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is the power of the creature tapped this way.', 'Trample\\nWhenever a creature you control with trample attacks, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Vengeful Firebrand has haste as long as a Warrior card is in your graveyard.\\n{R}: Vengeful Firebrand gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Vigilance, haste', 'Vigilance, trample', "Vigilance, trample\\nWhenever Meglonoth blocks a creature, Meglonoth deals damage to that creature's controller equal to Meglonoth's power.", 'When Civic Wayfinder enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', "When Denizen of the Deep enters the battlefield, return each other creature you control to its owner's hand.", 'When Elvish Visionary enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'When Farhaven Elf enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'When Gravedigger enters the battlefield, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Hidden Horror enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you discard a creature card.', 'When Mudbutton Torchrunner dies, it deals 3 damage to any target.', 'When Ravenous Rats enters the battlefield, target opponent discards a card.', 'When Sprouting Thrinax dies, create three 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens.', 'When Venerable Monk enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a black spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a blue spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a green spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a red spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a white spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever an opponent casts a spell, that player mills two cards.', 'Whenever an opponent discards a card, Megrim deals 2 damage to that player.', 'Whenever an opponent draws a card, Underworld Dreams deals 1 damage to that player.', 'Whenever another creature dies, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Deathbringer Thoctar.\\nRemove a +1/+1 counter from Deathbringer Thoctar: It deals 1 damage to any target.', "Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, you may put X +1/+1 counters on Hamletback Goliath, where X is that creature's power.", 'Whenever you cast an Elf spell, you may create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token.', 'White creatures you control get +1/+1.', "{1}, Sacrifice Wanderer's Twig: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.", '{1}{B}, {T}: Target player loses 1 life.', "{2}{W}, {T}, Sacrifice Dispeller's Capsule: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.", '{3}{G}: Knight of the Skyward Eye gets +3/+3 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', '{4}, {T}: Draw a card.', "{5}{R}{R}: Create a 5/5 red Dragon creature token with flying. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", "{B}: Regenerate Drudge Skeletons. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", '{R}: Flamekin Brawler gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice Terramorphic Expanse: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {G}{G}.', '{T}: Add {U}, {B}, or {R}.', '{T}: Cinder Pyromancer deals 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.\\nWhenever you cast a red spell, you may untap Cinder Pyromancer.', '{T}: Prodigal Pyromancer deals 1 damage to any target.', '{T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature for each Elf you control.', '{T}: Target player draws a card, then discards a card.', '{T}: Target player loses 1 life.', "{U}, {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.\\n{R}, {T}: Target creature can't block this turn."]
flavor: ['Los elementales de tierra tienen la fortaleza eterna de la piedra y la resistencia de las montañas. En contacto primordial con la tierra que habitan, contemplan las cosas a largo plazo y desprecian la prisa impetuosa de las criaturas mortales de vida efímera.', 'Los gigantes más iracundos son normalmente los armeros más diestros. Sus agravios avivan interminables sesiones en la fragua, mientras se gruñen ferozmente a sí mismos.', 'Primero en cargar, primero en luchar.', 'Tan grácil como el ciervo saltando el arroyo y tan mortal como el lobo emboscando del otro lado, los guerreros élficos son los ojos del bosque al igual que sus garras desnudas.']
artist: ['Adam Rex', 'Alan Pollack', 'Alex Horley-Orlandelli', 'Anthony Francisco', 'Anthony S. Waters', 'Arnie Swekel', 'Ben Thompson', 'Brandon Kitkouski', 'Brian Snõddy', 'Brom', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Carl Frank', 'Chris Rahn', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Christopher Rush', 'Cyril Van Der Haegen', 'D. Alexander Gregory', 'Daarken', 'Dan Dos Santos', 'Dan Frazier', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Dany Orizio', 'Daren Bader', 'Darrell Riche', 'Dave Allsop', 'Dave Dorman', 'David Palumbo', 'Dermot Power', 'DiTerlizzi', 'Dominick Domingo', 'Don Hazeltine', 'Donato Giancola', 'Doug Chaffee', 'E. M. Gist', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Fred Fields', 'Gary Leach', 'Gary Ruddell', 'Glen Angus', 'Greg Staples', 'Heather Hudson', 'Howard Lyon', 'Izzy', 'Jaime Jones', 'Jarreau Wimberly', 'Jason Chan', 'Jeff Easley', 'Jeffrey R. Busch', 'Jeremy Jarvis', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Jim Murray', 'Jim Nelson', 'Jim Pavelec', 'John Avon', 'John Howe', 'John Matson', 'Jon Foster', 'Jon J Muth', 'Joshua Hagler', 'Justin Sweet', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Larry MacDougall', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Mark Romanoski', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Zug', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Stewart', 'Michael Bruinsma', 'Michael Komarck', 'Michael Sutfin', 'Michael Weaver', 'Nic Klein', 'Nick Percival', 'Nils Hamm', 'Paolo Parente', 'Paolo Parente & Brian Snõddy', 'Paul Bonner', 'Pete Venters', 'Puddnhead', 'Ralph Horsley', 'Randy Gallegos', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Rebecca Guay', 'Richard Kane Ferguson', 'Richard Sardinha', 'Rob Alexander', 'Robert Bliss', 'Ron Spears', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Sam Wood', 'Scott Bailey', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Steve Ellis', 'Steve Luke', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Terese Nielsen & Ron Spencer', 'Thomas M. Baxa', 'Tim Hildebrandt', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tom Fleming', 'Una Fricker', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Warren Mahy', 'Wayne England', 'Wayne Reynolds', "William O'Connor", 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai', 'rk post']
